# Who reviews changes to each part of hiRobot. GitHub requests a review from the
# owners of every path a pull request touches; the last matching line wins.
#
# When you add or take over a driver, add your handle to its line here and to
# `maintainers:` in the driver's manifest.yaml. tests/test_codeowners.py fails
# when a driver directory with a manifest has no line below.

# Default: the core (types, embodiment, registry, safety, config loader), docs, CI.
*                                                   @artpli

# The safety gate and the Robot contract: every driver depends on them.
/src/hirobot/safety.py                              @artpli
/src/hirobot/robot.py                               @artpli

